# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets custom response headers (applies to every
# static response; see docs.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/).
#
# CSP note: the primary Content-Security-Policy (script-src/style-src, hash-based
# per page) is generated by Astro's `security.csp` feature as a <meta> tag — see
# astro.config.mjs. `frame-ancestors` is deliberately NOT set there because
# browsers ignore that directive when delivered via <meta>; it only works as a
# real HTTP header, which is what this file provides. Multiple CSP delivery
# mechanisms each enforce their own directives independently — this header's
# frame-ancestors doesn't conflict with or duplicate the meta tag's script-src.
#
# Scoped deliberately, not maximally: this is a static site with no user
# sessions, no forms, no third-party embeds, and no SharedArrayBuffer/WASM
# threading use case, so COEP/cross-origin-isolation and Trusted Types
# enforcement (which needs React's dangerouslySetInnerHTML sink in
# SearchIsland.tsx to go through a Trusted Types policy — non-trivial framework
# integration for a single sink that only ever receives Pagefind's own excerpt
# HTML over already-reviewed, already-published content, never a raw search
# query) are not proportionate here. Revisit if that changes.
#
# HSTS max-age is intentionally short (300s), not the eventual 1-year value:
# nothing has been deployed yet, so HTTPS/DNS stability on the real domain has
# never been verified. Shipping a long max-age before that verification is
# exactly the misconfiguration risk that can strand a domain (every browser that
# saw the header keeps forcing HTTPS until it expires, even against a broken
# config). Increasing it to a year is a launch-checklist step, done only after
# HTTPS is confirmed solid in production — see
# docs/research/architecture-research-report.md launch blockers.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=300; includeSubDomains
